{"unit_id":"eaglezlee__dsh-ui-html#card-zh","repo":"eaglezlee/dsh-ui-html","commit":"5ef7d44927e1c505b8d42e7abe066aa055419e6a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-html 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的交互式 HTML 界面插件，提供 show_ui 工具，将模型生成的 HTML 显示为对话中的界面卡片。用户可在页面中选择、填写或提交结构化事件，默认模式会把提交作为新用户消息送回会话；也可选择等待模式将事件作为工具结果返回。界面在隔离 iframe 中呈现，并可通过配置允许的资源来源及主题变量适配页面。适合需要在对话内收集用户输入或展示交互面板的场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:66-80","lib/tool.js:103-168","lib/client.js:338-399"]}
{"unit_id":"eaglezlee__dsh-ui-html#card-en","repo":"eaglezlee/dsh-ui-html","commit":"5ef7d44927e1c505b8d42e7abe066aa055419e6a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ui-html renders model-provided HTML as an interactive card in DSH Web conversations. With show_ui, users submit structured choices that return as a new user message by default, or as a tool result in waiting mode. The isolated iframe supports configured resource origins and host theme variables.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:66-80","lib/tool.js:103-168","lib/client.js:338-399"]}
